# `artifacts.patch`

Patch an artifact's metadata (name / owner / expiry).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.artifacts.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `id` | `string` | yes |
| `name` | `string?` | no |
| `owner_actor` | `string?` | no |
| `expires_at` | `string?` | no |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

```
ship ops call artifacts.patch --json '{ "id": "" }'
```

Kind: command.
